{"slug": "dusk-to-dawn-970b7d57", "synopsis": "Produced by the Federal Aviation Administration in 1971, *Dusk to Dawn* presents precautions and techniques for night flying. It addresses reduced color vision, spatial disorientation, and vertigo, emphasizing repeated instrument checks. Guidance covers runway-light references, landing-gear and landing-light checks, takeoff attitude, climb speed, and pressure-related altimeter errors that can cause unsafe descents.", "clips": [{"id": "b3d0b440-6439-5bd9-95c8-935fe03d8b1a", "sourceSlug": "dusk-to-dawn-970b7d57", "sourceTitle": "Dusk to Dawn", "sourceYear": 1971, "position": 0, "startSeconds": 0.0, "endSeconds": 8.942, "videoUrl": "https://pub-075ff01374c04555b51c9bc50f258b42.r2.dev/sources/970b7d57-8a99-5842-b390-2b6ac1f3f004/v4-conditional-luna-1/clips/b3d0b440-6439-5bd9-95c8-935fe03d8b1a.mp4", "thumbnailUrl": "https://pub-075ff01374c04555b51c9bc50f258b42.r2.dev/sources/970b7d57-8a99-5842-b390-2b6ac1f3f004/v4-conditional-luna-1/thumbnails/b3d0b440-6439-5bd9-95c8-935fe03d8b1a.jpg"}, {"id": "5b151841-c7ef-5b0e-b1f0-ed8891a4d018", "sourceSlug": "dusk-to-dawn-970b7d57", "sourceTitle": "Dusk to Dawn", "sourceYear": 1971, "position": 1, "startSeconds": 8.942, "endSeconds": 28.462, "videoUrl": "https://pub-075ff01374c04555b51c9bc50f258b42.r2.dev/sources/970b7d57-8a99-5842-b390-2b6ac1f3f004/v4-conditional-luna-1/clips/5b151841-c7ef-5b0e-b1f0-ed8891a4d018.mp4", "thumbnailUrl": "https://pub-075ff01374c04555b51c9bc50f258b42.r2.dev/sources/970b7d57-8a99-5842-b390-2b6ac1f3f004/v4-conditional-luna-1/thumbnails/5b151841-c7ef-5b0e-b1f0-ed8891a4d018.jpg"}, {"id": "98f09e1e-3c61-5076-ae3c-11e3d5592c15", "sourceSlug": "dusk-to-dawn-970b7d57", "sourceTitle": "Dusk to Dawn", "sourceYear": 1971, "position": 2, "startSeconds": 28.462, "endSeconds": 34.801, "videoUrl": "https://pub-075ff01374c04555b51c9bc50f258b42.r2.dev/sources/970b7d57-8a99-5842-b390-2b6ac1f3f004/v4-conditional-luna-1/clips/98f09e1e-3c61-5076-ae3c-11e3d5592c15.mp4", "thumbna